<Base
  title="Tuning CycloneDDS to fix LiDAR data delivery problems · Surabhi Gupta"
  description="Root-causing a cross-machine LiDAR/IMU data delivery failure to IP fragmentation, and fixing it via CycloneDDS config tuning."
>
  <div class="col writeup-header">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);">
      Tuning CycloneDDS to fix LiDAR data delivery problems
    </h1>
    <p class="writeup-byline">
      Surabhi Gupta &middot; September 5, 2026
    </p>
  </div>

